"The meter is drawn with Core Animation, so the render server interpolates the frames. The app only picks the next target every 0.33s, and stops entirely when the display sleeps. Measured idle CPU: 0.05%.\n\nLyrics come from lrclib.net. The track title, artist, album and duration are sent to that server; no account or key is involved. Turn this off if you would rather not." = "仪表使用 Core Animation 绘制，帧插值由渲染服务器负责。应用每 0.33 秒只确定下一个目标值，屏幕休眠时则完全停止。实测空闲 CPU 为 0.05%。\n\n歌词来自 lrclib.net。曲名、艺人、专辑和时长会发送到该服务器，无需账号或密钥。若不希望如此，请关闭。";
"The notch is always pinned to a private window server Space. That is what keeps it from sliding away when you switch desktops, and what keeps it above full-screen apps — a real notch is hardware, and hardware does not move." = "刘海始终固定在一个私有的窗口服务器 Space 上。正因如此，切换桌面时它不会一起滑走，也会保持在全屏应用之上——真正的刘海是硬件，硬件是不会动的。";
