"Uses Apple’s own spring notation — duration plus bounce. Like the Island is 340ms at 0.18, Bouncy is 460ms at 0.28, Gentle is 580ms at 0.04. Closing is a little shorter with 0.12 more bounce, so it undershoots the resting size and settles back. The exact curves are in the Motion Lab tab, frame by frame." = "直接采用 Apple 的弹簧表示法——持续时间加回弹。“与灵动岛一致”为 340ms、0.18，“有弹性”为 460ms、0.28，“柔和”为 580ms、0.04。收起时略短且回弹增加 0.12，因此会缩得比静止尺寸更小再弹回。精确曲线可在“动效实验室”标签中逐帧查看。";
